    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/best-western-premier-seoul-garden-hotel/hotel/seoul-kr.html",
    "name": "Seoul Garden Hotel",
    "detail": "I have stayed all over the city of Seoul in various hotels to experience both the neighborhoods and the restaurants. I have never stayed here before and didn’t really know what to expect especially with the price being so reasonable. But I was completely surprised to see and experience such a high quality establishment. From the comfortable beds to the spacious bathrooms. Not to mention the incredible restaurant on the premises. I am truly surprised and happy at such an incredible experience. I look forward to future visits at this location as well as possibly joining their membership program. The location offers a huge selection of restaurants around the premises as well as convenience of mass transit access via bus or metro. It truly has the beauty and prestige expected of a big hotel in a busy and competitive city. Thank you to the kind and caring staff for taking that EXTRA time to make it a memorable and SPECIAL visit for me. Truly an unforgettable stay in such an incredible city.",
